--- !u!114 &369881632
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 369881610}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 186
  indentLevel: 0
  text: "S\xE9 que puede costar, pero esto es como el tabaco. Establece unos objetivos
    semanales e intenta reducir su paso por el casino poco a poco."
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 369881636}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
--- !u!114 &369881633
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 369881610}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 185
  indentLevel: 0
  text: "Tienes a tu familia a tu lado, Ram\xF3n. Siempre han estado apoy\xE1ndote,
    por muy grave que fuese la situaci\xF3n. Ap\xF3yate en la gente que te quiere,
    saldr\xE1s m\xE1s fuerte de esta."
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 369881641}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
--- !u!114 &369881634
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 369881610}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 841589fc622bc494aa5405f416fa1301, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 184
  indentLevel: 0
  text: "Recuerda cual fue la motivaci\xF3n inicial que te incit\xF3 a dejar la ludopat\xEDa.
    Af\xE9rrate a ella y trata de recordarla cada vez que quieras pisar un casino."
  description: 
  targetBlock: {fileID: 369881643}
  hideIfVisited: 0
  interactable:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 1
  setMenuDialog: {fileID: 0}
  hideThisOption:
    booleanRef: {fileID: 0}
    booleanVal: 0
